WEBVTT

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:19.200
(Gather around We are family)

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:39.400
Fuego que brilla
(Fire that shines)

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:43.700
En la noche
(In the night)

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:47.300
Sin ningún
(Without any)

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:51.600
Grave reproche
(Grave reproach)

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:55.700
Cantamos juntos
(We sing together)

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:59.800
Bebiendo ron
(Drinking rum)

00:00:59.900 --> 00:01:04.000
Curando todo
(Curing all)

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:07.400
El corazón
(The heart)

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:12.100
Somos parias
(We are outcasts You and me)

00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:15.800
Pero hay lealtad
(But there is loyalty As you see)

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:20.000
Nuestra familia
(Our family Stand together)

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:23.900
Contra el mundo
(Against the world Stormy weather)

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:26.100
Pase lo que
(Whatever happens)

00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:28.000
Pase hoy
(Happens today)

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:29.800
Yo sé muy bien
(I know very well)

00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:42.300
Con quién estoy
(Who I am with Who I am with)

00:02:04.900 --> 00:02:06.100
Risas y cuentos

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:08.100
Del pasado

00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:11.400
Siempre estaré
(I will always be)

00:02:11.700 --> 00:02:12.800
A tu lado

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:15.500
El mundo cambia
(The world changes)

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:17.000
Se hace cruel

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:19.400
Pero yo siempre
(But I will always)

00:02:19.400 --> 00:02:20.500
Seré fiel

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:24.000
Somos parias
(We are outcasts You and me)

00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:28.000
Pero hay lealtad
(But there is loyalty As you see)

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:32.300
Nuestra familia
(Our family Stand together)

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:36.500
Contra el mundo
(Against the world Stormy weather)

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:13.500
Buenas noches.
(Goodnight.)

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:31.000
Buenas noches.
(Goodnight. Rest well. We are family.)
